## Claw Command - psionics port: the Mana alert shown in the status bar.
##
## AlertPrototype.Name and .Description are plain strings, but the alert tooltip runs them through Loc, so
## they stay as ids here (unlike action entities, whose name/description are used verbatim by the UI).

alerts-mana-name = Mana Level
alerts-mana-desc = How much mana is available to spend on your powers.
